/-!
# A264131

T(n,k)=Number of (n+1)X(k+1) arrays of permutations of 0..(n+1)*(k+1)-1 with each element having index change +-(.,.) 0,0 0,2 or 1,2.

The 41 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A264131

/-- Known terms of `flat`, starting at index `1`. -/
def flatData : List flatRetType :=
  [1, 5, 1, 25, 13, 1, 80, 169, 34, 1,
    256, 1040, 1156, 89, 1, 976, 6400, 13600, 7921, 233,
